{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33955","headline":"临顿宅将有归于之日鲁望以诗见贶因抒怀詶之 · 皮日休","name":"临顿宅将有归于之日鲁望以诗见贶因抒怀詶之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共老林泉忍暂分，此生应不识回文。\n几枚竹笥送德曜，一乘柴车迎少君。\n举案品多缘涧药，承家事少爲谿云。\n居然自是幽人事，辄莫教他孙寿闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}